{
	"info": {
		"name": "LarpingApp API Contract Suite",
		"description": "Newman/Postman API-contract tests for the LarpingApp Nextcloud app. Locks the HTTP contract of larpingapp's surfaces: (1) the LARP domain objects (characters, items, skills, conditions, effects, events, players) exercised through the OpenRegister object API per ADR-022 — larpingapp owns no domain-CRUD controller, it is a thin OR client; (2) the larpingapp Settings controller (GET /api/settings, POST /api/settings, POST /api/settings/reimport); (3) the character PDF compute endpoint (GET /characters/{id}/download/{template}).\n\nEvery family is exercised for a happy path, an error/validation case (4xx, never 500), and an authorization case (no/invalid auth -> 401/403). The suite is self-contained and idempotent: it seeds the OpenRegister objects it needs in setup and deletes everything it creates in teardown.\n\nAUTH MODEL: collection auth is noauth; every authenticated request carries an EXPLICIT basic-auth block (admin:admin via adminUser/adminPass). The no-auth / invalid-auth requests target {{noAuthBase}} (127.0.0.1) so the host-scoped NC session cookie established on {{baseUrl}} (localhost) is never sent to them — keeping authz tests genuinely unauthenticated. Run with --ignore-redirects so NC's 401/303 is asserted directly. See run-newman.sh.\n\nNote (ADR-022): OpenRegister object READS are not auth-gated (anonymous GET returns 200 — authorization on object data is OR's responsibility), but object WRITES (POST/PUT/DELETE) DO require auth. OR's ObjectsController is a PublicPage enforcing its own RBAC, so it refuses an anonymous write with 403 and an explicit denial rather than the NC-middleware 401 — the authz test accepts either and then reads the store back to prove nothing was written.\n\nFIXTURE NOTE: character.ocName is `format: uuid, $ref: player` — the LINK to the owning player object, not a display name. The character section therefore seeds a player first and references its UUID; a plain string is (correctly) rejected 400 by OpenRegister.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "noAuthBase", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080" },
		{ "key": "adminUser", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "adminPass", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "register", "value": "larpingapp" },
		{ "key": "charSchema", "value": "character" },
		{ "key": "itemSchema", "value": "larping_item" },
		{ "key": "skillSchema", "value": "skill" },
		{ "key": "conditionSchema", "value": "condition" },
		{ "key": "effectSchema", "value": "effect" },
		{ "key": "eventSchema", "value": "larping_event" },
		{ "key": "playerSchema", "value": "player" },
		{ "key": "charId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "charPlayerId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "itemId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "skillId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "conditionId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "effectId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "eventId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "playerId", "value": "" }
	],
	"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Character (OR object CRUD, ADR-022)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "SETUP: create the player a character must reference (character.ocName is a UUID relation)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"// character.ocName is `type: string, format: uuid, $ref: player` in",
									"// lib/Settings/larpingapp_register.json — it is the LINK to the owning",
									"// player object, not a display name. OpenRegister rejects a non-UUID",
									"// value with 400 'should match format uuid'. So the character fixture",
									"// needs a real player to point at; seed it here and reference its id.",
									"pm.test('setup player created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);",
									"pm.test('setup player id is a uuid', () => pm.expect(id).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i));",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('charPlayerId', id);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN character owner\",\n  \"description\": \"setup fixture: the player that NEWMAN character belongs to\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{playerSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{playerSchema}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Create character (201/200)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('character created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);",
									"pm.test('returns an id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
									"pm.test('echoes the name', () => pm.expect(b.name).to.eql('NEWMAN character'));",
									"// The player relation must round-trip: a write that silently dropped",
									"// ocName would otherwise look identical to a correct one.",
									"pm.test('stores the player relation', () => pm.expect(b.ocName).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('charPlayerId')));",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('charId', id);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN character\",\n  \"ocName\": \"{{charPlayerId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"api-contract probe\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Read character (200)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('character read (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);",
									"pm.test('id matches created', () => pm.expect(id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('charId')));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}/{{charId}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}", "{{charId}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "List characters (200, results array)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('list (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('has results array', () => pm.expect(b.results).to.be.an('array'));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}?_limit=5", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}" ], "query": [ { "key": "_limit", "value": "5" } ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Update character (200)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('character updated (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('description updated', () => pm.expect(b.description).to.eql('updated by newman'));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN character\",\n  \"ocName\": \"{{charPlayerId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"updated by newman\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}/{{charId}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}", "{{charId}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Create character ERROR: missing required ocName (400, not 500)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('validation rejected with 4xx not 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(400, 499));",
									"pm.test('not a 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"no name nor ocName provided\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Read character AUTHZ: anonymous single-object read returns 404 (owner-scoped)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"// Authorization on object data is OpenRegister's responsibility (ADR-022),",
									"// not larpingapp's. The character schema carries an `ownerUid`, so OR scopes",
									"// a single-object read to the owner: an anonymous GET of an admin-owned",
									"// character returns 404 (Not Found for the anonymous context), NOT the",
									"// object. We assert that honestly — the data is not leaked to anon, and OR",
									"// (not larpingapp) enforces it. (The unscoped LIST endpoint returns 200 to",
									"// anon but only exposes the anon-visible subset.)",
									"pm.test('anonymous single-object read returns 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"url": { "raw": "{{noAuthBase}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}/{{charId}}", "host": [ "{{noAuthBase}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}", "{{charId}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Create character AUTHZ: anonymous write is rejected (401/403)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"// OR object WRITES require authentication. OpenRegister's ObjectsController is a",
									"// PublicPage that enforces its OWN RBAC, so an anonymous write is answered with 403",
									"// and an explicit denial (\"User 'Anonymous' does not have permission to 'create'",
									"// objects in schema 'Character'\") rather than the NC-middleware 401. Both are honest",
									"// rejections; the contract locked here is that the write is REFUSED and nothing is",
									"// stored — the follow-up request reads the store back to prove the second half.",
									"pm.test('anonymous OR write rejected (401 or 403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]));",
									"let anonBody = null;",
									"try { anonBody = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { anonBody = null; }",
									"pm.test('rejection echoes no created object id', () => {",
									"    const id = anonBody && (anonBody.id || (anonBody['@self'] && anonBody['@self'].id));",
									"    pm.expect(id, 'a rejected write must not echo a stored object').to.be.not.ok;",
									"});"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN anon write probe\",\n  \"ocName\": \"{{charPlayerId}}\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{noAuthBase}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}", "host": [ "{{noAuthBase}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}" ] }
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Create character AUTHZ: the rejected anonymous write stored nothing",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"// A rejection status is only half the evidence — read the store back and prove the",
									"// object is genuinely absent. The anonymous payload above was FULLY VALID (a real",
									"// player UUID for ocName), so the only thing that could have stopped it was the",
									"// authorization check; a fail-open would surface here as total >= 1.",
									"pm.test('store queried (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('anonymous write stored nothing', () => pm.expect(b.total).to.eql(0));",
									"pm.test('no character matches the anonymous probe', () => pm.expect((b.results || []).length).to.eql(0));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{charSchema}}?name=NEWMAN anon write probe&_limit=5", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{charSchema}}" ], "query": [ { "key": "name", "value": "NEWMAN anon write probe" }, { "key": "_limit", "value": "5" } ] }
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Domain objects (item / skill / condition / effect / event / player)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create item (2xx)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('item created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));", "const b = pm.response.json(); const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);", "pm.test('item id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);", "pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', id);" ] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN item\",\n  \"description\": \"probe item\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{itemSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{itemSchema}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create skill (2xx)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('skill created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));", "const b = pm.response.json(); const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);", "pm.test('skill id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);", "pm.collectionVariables.set('skillId', id);" ] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN skill\",\n  \"description\": \"probe skill\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{skillSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{skillSchema}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create condition (2xx)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('condition created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));", "const b = pm.response.json(); const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);", "pm.test('condition id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);", "pm.collectionVariables.set('conditionId', id);" ] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN condition\",\n  \"description\": \"probe condition\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{conditionSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{conditionSchema}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create effect (2xx)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('effect created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));", "const b = pm.response.json(); const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);", "pm.test('effect id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);", "pm.collectionVariables.set('effectId', id);" ] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN effect\",\n  \"description\": \"probe effect\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{effectSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{effectSchema}}" ] } }
				},
				{
					"name": "Create event (2xx)",
					"event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('event created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));", "const b = pm.response.json(); const id = b.id || (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id);", "pm.test('event id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);", "pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', id);" ] } } ],
					"request": { "auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] }, "method": "POST", "header": [ { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"NEWMAN event\",\n  \"description\": \"probe event\"\n}" }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/{{register}}/{{eventSchema}}", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "{{register}}", "{{eventSchema}}" ] } }
				},
				{
